<nav class=\"product-heading__nav\" id=\"nav-6af745a57d775\">\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#delivery-2\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Delivery</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#payment-2\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Payment</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#guarantee-2\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Guarantee</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"delivery-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Nova Post  branch delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p>Nova Post  parcel locker delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p>Nova Post courier delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://betrendy.space/oplata-i-dostavka/\">More about delivery</a></p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"payment-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Payment to the current account:</p>\n<p>Beneficiary: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED] Mariia Borysivna</p>\n<p>IBAN: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Online payment via Plata by mono</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"guarantee-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>12-month manufacturer's warranty.</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__column-item\">\n<div class=\"product__group product__group--tabs\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<nav class=\"product-heading__nav\" id=\"nav-6af745a57d819\">\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#description-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Description</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#reviews-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\"><div id=\"comments\">\n            A new review or comment    </div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"description-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Frangipani &amp; Acai Perfumed Shower Mousse</strong><br/>\r\nWith frangipani and acai berry extracts.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/frangipani-and-acai-04.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/frangipani-acai-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/><br/>\r\nLight and gentle shower mousse features an <strong>incredible consistency and an advanced formula</strong> for delicate skin cleansing. <strong>Its weightless texture </strong>envelops the body in clouds of softness, delivering unforgettable <strong>hydration.</strong> Immerse yourself in gentle indulgence with Be Trendy products.</p>\n<p><strong>Frangipani Extract. </strong>A powerful antioxidant. It gives the skin a fresh, healthy look, helps provide extra protection against free radicals and premature aging, and supports the restoration and regeneration of surface cells. It leaves the skin feeling tender, smooth, and elastic.<br/>\n<strong>Acai Berry Extract.</strong> Regular use of products containing acai berry extract can help even out skin tone and impart a healthy glow, helping to keep the skin firm and youthful.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-04(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/frangipani-acai-04.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>The fragrance crafts an elegant and sophisticated signature, mesmerizing with its richness and perfect harmony. It opens with fresh, juicy notes of <strong>green mandarin, sweet orange, and fragrant pear.</strong> At the heart of the scent, a gorgeous bouquet <strong>of jasmine and lily blooms, </strong>adding floral tenderness and refinement. The base notes unfold <strong>into salty vanilla, sandalwood, and amber,</strong> giving the composition its depth, warmth, and impressive longevity.<br/>\r\n </p>\n<p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vv4N5AQwcUw\">https://www.youtube.com/embed/vv4N5AQwcUw</a></p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uid7d71e3b35f9ac8226168407b07791c94\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uid7d71e3b35f9ac8226168407b07791c94\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"d093502e5f7019337ef22b8c7406911a\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_1\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"e82a3041a89755ddb5da155c10c6f089\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>